# 统一文本文件行尾为 LF，避免跨平台（Windows/Linux 混用）时
# 整文件被重写，把真实改动淹没在数千行行尾噪音里。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 解析会出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源，禁止任何行尾/编码转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.glsl text eol=lf
*.apk binary
*.jar binary
